                <p>[For text of Agreement and explanatory memorandum signed at New Delhi February 2,
                    1950, entered into force on that date, see <hi rendition="#italic">United States
                        Treaties and Other International Agreements</hi> (UST), volume 1, page 383.]</p>
                <p rendition="#center">AGREEMENT BETWEEN THE UNITED STATES AND INDIA CONCERNING
                    TECHNICAL COOPERATION</p>
                <p>[For text of Agreement signed at New Delhi December 28, 1950, entered into force
                    on that date, see 2 UST (1) 425.]</p>
